{
  "name": "yreview",
  "displayName": "Yreview",
  "description": "Review comments that live in git notes. The same comments show in the Yreview plugin for JetBrains IDEs.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "publisher": "yeskiy",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "icon": "images/icon.png",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/yeskiy/yreview.git",
    "directory": "vscode"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/yeskiy/yreview/tree/main/vscode#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/yeskiy/yreview/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.101.0",
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "code review",
    "review comments",
    "git notes",
    "git-appraise"
  ],
  "extensionKind": [
    "workspace"
  ],
  "capabilities": {
    "untrustedWorkspaces": {
      "supported": false,
      "description": "Yreview runs git, and git reads the repository configuration, which can name programs."
    },
    "virtualWorkspaces": false
  },
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "yreview.showLog",
        "title": "Show Log",
        "category": "Yreview"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.addComment",
        "title": "Add Review Comment",
        "category": "Yreview"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.saveLocal",
        "title": "Save Local"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.saveShared",
        "title": "Save Shared"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.discard",
        "title": "Discard"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.closeBox",
        "title": "Close Comment Box"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.resolve",
        "title": "Resolve",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.delete",
        "title": "Delete",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.tasks.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh Review Tasks",
        "category": "Yreview",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.tasks.open",
        "title": "Open Review Task"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.filter",
        "title": "Filter",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.showResolved",
        "title": "Show Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.hideResolved",
        "title": "Hide Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye-closed)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.groupBy",
        "title": "Group By",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.previous",
        "title": "Previous Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-up)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.next",
        "title": "Next Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-down)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.checkAll",
        "title": "Check All",
        "icon": "$(check-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.clearChecks",
        "title": "Clear Checks",
        "icon": "$(clear-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.resolve",
        "title": "Resolve",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.project.delete",
        "title": "Delete",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.filter",
        "title": "Filter",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.showResolved",
        "title": "Show Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.hideResolved",
        "title": "Hide Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye-closed)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.groupBy",
        "title": "Group By",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.previous",
        "title": "Previous Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-up)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.next",
        "title": "Next Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-down)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.checkAll",
        "title": "Check All",
        "icon": "$(check-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.clearChecks",
        "title": "Clear Checks",
        "icon": "$(clear-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.resolve",
        "title": "Resolve",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.currentFile.delete",
        "title": "Delete",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.filter",
        "title": "Filter",
        "icon": "$(filter)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.showResolved",
        "title": "Show Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.hideResolved",
        "title": "Hide Resolved Comments",
        "icon": "$(eye-closed)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.groupBy",
        "title": "Group By",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.previous",
        "title": "Previous Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-up)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.next",
        "title": "Next Task",
        "icon": "$(arrow-down)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.checkAll",
        "title": "Check All",
        "icon": "$(check-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.clearChecks",
        "title": "Clear Checks",
        "icon": "$(clear-all)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.resolve",
        "title": "Resolve",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.changes.delete",
        "title": "Delete",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      }
    ],
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "yreview",
          "title": "Yreview",
          "icon": "images/activity.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "yreview": [
        {
          "id": "yreview.project",
          "name": "Project",
          "contextualTitle": "Yreview"
        },
        {
          "id": "yreview.currentFile",
          "name": "Current File",
          "contextualTitle": "Yreview",
          "visibility": "collapsed"
        },
        {
          "id": "yreview.changes",
          "name": "Local Changes",
          "contextualTitle": "Yreview",
          "visibility": "collapsed"
        }
      ]
    },
    "menus": {
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.addComment",
          "when": "editorIsOpen && resourceScheme =~ /^(file|git)$/"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveLocal",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveShared",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.discard",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.closeBox",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.resolve",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.delete",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.tasks.open",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.filter",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.showResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.hideResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.groupBy",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.previous",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.next",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.checkAll",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.clearChecks",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.resolve",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.delete",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.filter",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.showResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.hideResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.groupBy",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.previous",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.next",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.checkAll",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.clearChecks",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.resolve",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.delete",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.filter",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.showResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.hideResolved",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.groupBy",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.previous",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.next",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.checkAll",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.clearChecks",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.resolve",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.delete",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ],
      "editor/context": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.addComment",
          "when": "resourceScheme =~ /^(file|git)$/",
          "group": "z_yreview@1"
        }
      ],
      "comments/commentThread/context": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveLocal",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThreadIsEmpty && config.yreview.newComments != shared"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveShared",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThreadIsEmpty && config.yreview.newComments != shared"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveShared",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThreadIsEmpty && config.yreview.newComments == shared"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.saveLocal",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThreadIsEmpty && config.yreview.newComments == shared"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.discard",
          "group": "inline@3",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThreadIsEmpty"
        }
      ],
      "comments/commentThread/title": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.resolve",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && commentThread == yreview.open"
        }
      ],
      "comments/comment/title": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.delete",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == yreview && comment == yreview.comment"
        }
      ],
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.tasks.refresh",
          "when": "view == yreview.project || view == yreview.currentFile || view == yreview.changes",
          "group": "navigation@9"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.filter",
          "when": "view == yreview.project",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.showResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && !yreview.project.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.hideResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && yreview.project.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.groupBy",
          "when": "view == yreview.project",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.previous",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && yreview.project.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.next",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && yreview.project.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.checkAll",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && yreview.project.anyTask",
          "group": "2_checks@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.clearChecks",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && yreview.project.anyCheck",
          "group": "2_checks@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.project",
          "group": "3_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.project",
          "group": "3_write@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.filter",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.showResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && !yreview.currentFile.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.hideResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && yreview.currentFile.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.groupBy",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.previous",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && yreview.currentFile.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.next",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && yreview.currentFile.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.checkAll",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && yreview.currentFile.anyTask",
          "group": "2_checks@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.clearChecks",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && yreview.currentFile.anyCheck",
          "group": "2_checks@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile",
          "group": "3_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile",
          "group": "3_write@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.filter",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.showResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && !yreview.changes.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.hideResolved",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && yreview.changes.resolvedShown",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.groupBy",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.previous",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && yreview.changes.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.next",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && yreview.changes.anyTask",
          "group": "1_move@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.checkAll",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && yreview.changes.anyTask",
          "group": "2_checks@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.clearChecks",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && yreview.changes.anyCheck",
          "group": "2_checks@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes",
          "group": "3_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes",
          "group": "3_write@2"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.project.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.project && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.currentFile.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.currentFile && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.resolve",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "yreview.changes.delete",
          "when": "view == yreview.changes && viewItem =~ /^yreview\\./",
          "group": "1_write@2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "yreview.addComment",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+g",
        "mac": "cmd+alt+g",
        "when": "editorTextFocus"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.addComment",
        "key": "ctrl+shift+g",
        "mac": "ctrl+shift+g",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && config.yreview.intellijKey"
      },
      {
        "command": "yreview.closeBox",
        "key": "escape",
        "when": "commentEditorFocused && commentController == yreview && !suggestWidgetVisible && !inlineSuggestionVisible && !parameterHintsVisible && !inSnippetMode"
      }
    ],
    "colors": [
      {
        "id": "yreview.commentRangeBackground",
        "description": "Background of the lines that an open review comment covers.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "editor.rangeHighlightBackground",
          "light": "editor.rangeHighlightBackground",
          "highContrast": null,
          "highContrastLight": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "yreview.commentOverlapBackground",
        "description": "Background of the text that two or more open review comments cover.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#d7a01a40",
          "light": "#e0a00040",
          "highContrast": null,
          "highContrastLight": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "yreview.commentOverlapBorder",
        "description": "Outline of the text that two or more open review comments cover. The high contrast themes use it in place of a background.",
        "defaults": {
          "dark": "#00000000",
          "light": "#00000000",
          "highContrast": "contrastActiveBorder",
          "highContrastLight": "contrastActiveBorder"
        }
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Yreview",
      "properties": {
        "yreview.newComments": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "local",
            "shared"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "A new comment goes to refs/notes/y-review/local and stays on this machine.",
            "A new comment goes to refs/notes/devtools/discuss and the extension pushes it to the remote."
          ],
          "default": "local",
          "scope": "resource",
          "markdownDescription": "The button that the comment box shows first. Both buttons stay available."
        },
        "yreview.remote": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "origin",
          "scope": "resource",
          "markdownDescription": "The git remote that gets the shared comments. It must be the name of a remote of the repository."
        },
        "yreview.writeRefspec": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "scope": "resource",
          "markdownDescription": "After a share, ask before the extension adds `refs/notes/devtools/*:refs/notes/devtools/*` to `remote.<name>.fetch`. With this box clear, the extension does not ask, and you add the line by hand."
        },
        "yreview.editorMarks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "scope": "resource",
          "markdownDescription": "Show the comment threads open and color the lines that an open comment covers."
        },
        "yreview.intellijKey": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "scope": "application",
          "markdownDescription": "Also bind Ctrl+Shift+G, the key of the IntelliJ plugin, to Add Review Comment while an editor has focus. It replaces Show Source Control there."
        },
        "yreview.todoPatterns": {
          "type": "array",
          "scope": "application",
          "default": [
            {
              "pattern": "\\btodo\\b.*",
              "caseSensitive": false
            },
            {
              "pattern": "\\bfixme\\b.*",
              "caseSensitive": false
            }
          ],
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "pattern"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "pattern": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "A JavaScript regular expression."
              },
              "caseSensitive": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false
              }
            }
          },
          "markdownDescription": "The TODO patterns of the task views. Each pattern is a JavaScript regular expression, and the TODO text is the part of the line that it matches, up to the end of the comment. Each pattern needs a word of two or more letters or digits outside every group, for example `\\btodo\\b.*`. Yreview reads the text of the files, so a TODO in a string also shows."
        },
        "yreview.todoFilters": {
          "type": "array",
          "scope": "application",
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "patterns"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "patterns": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "markdownDescription": "Named sets of TODO patterns. The Filter button of a task view offers each set. Each entry of `patterns` is a `pattern` value of `yreview.todoPatterns`."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "build:production": "node scripts/build.mjs --production",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "lint:fix": "eslint . --fix",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "prose": "node scripts/prose-check.mjs",
    "test": "npm run test:unit && npm run test:integration",
    "test:unit": "mocha",
    "test:integration": "node scripts/build.mjs --tests && node scripts/test-workspace.mjs && vscode-test",
    "package": "vsce package --no-dependencies",
    "vscode:prepublish": "node scripts/build.mjs --production"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "jsonc-parser": "3.3.1",
    "sqids": "0.3.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/compat": "2.1.1",
    "@eslint/js": "9.39.5",
    "@types/markdown-it": "14.2.0",
